.\"Raw Compiler 1"
.Dd November 14, 2026
.Dt RC 1
.Os Linux
.Sh NAME
.Nm Raw Compiler (rc)
.Nd Small compiler for the raw programming language.
Compiles .raw source files into elf32 binaries.
.Sh USAGE
.Nm rc
.Fl [opts]
.Ar [source files]
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It --assemble, -c
Just produce a .o file.
.It --help, -h
Print this message.
.It --out, -o [path. default: prog]
Set the binary's name.
.It --compile, -S
Just produce a .s file.
.El
